  "label": "User projected onto the scene of enjoying a warm beverage in a cold outdoor setting",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the scene 'enjoying_warm_beverage_outdoors' where the woman is depicted sitting in the bed of a pickup truck by a lake on a cold day, holding a warm beverage and wearing cozy winter attire. This projection is implicit, as the meme evokes a universal, relatable experience of finding comfort and warmth in a cold environment. The user identifies with the emotional state and activity described, projecting themselves onto the woman’s experience of simple pleasure and coziness. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you', but the scene and text create an implicit 'you' by inviting the viewer to imagine themselves in the same situation, enjoying a warm cup on a cold day.",
